        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 801AN, Arlington Double Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis solid brass handleset made by Kwikset has a lifetime mechanical warranty. Very sleek in design, the Arlington double cylinder door entrance set features beveled edges at the top and the bottom with a classic grip handle. A double cylinder handleset, it has a thumbpiece on the outside and a turnknob on the inside. The deadbolt is key operated on both the inside and the outside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Double Cylinder Handleset:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on both the inside and outside; and the latchbolt is operated by a turnknob inside and a thumbpiece outside. In order to increase security, double cylinder handlesets are usually used on front or back doors where there is a window in close proximity to the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/arlington-single-cylinder-handleset-kwikset-800an\"><b>Arlington Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a> and\r\n<a href=\"/products/arlington-dummy-cylinder-handleset-kwikset-802an\"><b>Arlington Dummy Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Arlington Double Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.5 Grade 1 Deadbolt</li>\r\n<li> SmartKey cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>Bump-resistant deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pry shield.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Polymer coating.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass with solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the 801AN Arlington Door Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length Overall: 19-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Length: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt to Latch Spacing: 5-1/2\" center to center</li>\r\n<li>Center of Latch to Center of Throughbolt:  11\"</li>\r\n<li>Cross Bore: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" doors.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: please specify</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options! \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
